00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,120
How can you play this little girl?

291
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:54,880
I'll walk behind.

292
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:55,840
I'll walk crouching.

293
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,720
You'll walk crouching?

294
00:09:58,274 --> 00:09:59,648
Honglei, you misunderstood.

295
00:09:59,648 --> 00:10:00,800
You are Mathilda.

296
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,840
You memorized the wrong lines.

297
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:10,000
(Trying to convince himself)
But in terms of height,

298
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,080
I think this is appropriate.

299
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,160
Yes. Right.

300
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:12,600
Alright then.

301
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,600
Let's use our Northeast dialect then.

302
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,000
Yep.

303
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,960
Don't do this kind of stupid thing.

304
00:10:17,184 --> 00:10:18,320
- Did you hear me?
- Yep.

305
00:10:18,688 --> 00:10:20,320
If it were me,
I wouldn't do it that way.

306
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,160
Wouldn't do it that way.

307
00:10:21,792 --> 00:10:22,800
That's not professional.

308
00:10:23,424 --> 00:10:25,120
This profession has its rules.

309
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:25,920
Yep.

310
00:10:26,464 --> 00:10:27,960
And don't always say "yep".

311
00:10:28,192 --> 00:10:29,360
Why all the "yeps"?

312
00:10:30,176 --> 00:10:30,560
Yep.

313
00:10:31,008 --> 00:10:31,680
Good.

314
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,608
Let's go.

315
00:10:32,608 --> 00:10:33,088
(Setting off to film)

316
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,144
I'll take the case.

317
00:10:34,144 --> 00:10:35,160
You hold the plant.

318
00:10:36,224 --> 00:10:36,800
You...

319
00:10:37,088 --> 00:10:38,480
(Strong wind incoming)

320
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,424
It's windy today.

321
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,160
See? Even the heavens don't agree.

322
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:42,720
The wind has picked up.

323
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,920
I'm playing Mathilda.

324
00:10:44,832 --> 00:10:46,120
What about the hairstyle?

325
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,400
I need that...

326
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,240
What's that hairstyle?

327
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:49,400
Bob cut.

328
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,360
Bob cut.

329
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,720
I don't have a bob cut.

330
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,360
No wig, right?

331
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,000
I only have the Honglei cut.

332
00:10:55,168 --> 00:10:55,968
(No wig, but there is a necklace)

333
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:56,680
This...

334
00:10:56,680 --> 00:10:57,480
This is that kind of...

335
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,720
This is the necklace Mathilda wears?

336
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,560
A classic necklace.

337
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,680
You can wear it as a bow tie.

338
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:11,120
Why do I feel like
Yuning is going to choke me?

339
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,088
So romantic.

340
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:15,680
I can't take it.

341
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,520
So romantic.

342
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,360
I feel like we're here to film a drama.

343
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,680
Exactly, like we are back on set.

344
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:23,160
Yeah.

345
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:23,936
Together every day.

346
00:11:25,312 --> 00:11:25,760
(Rehearsing)

347
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,008
Don't be silly all day long.

348
00:11:27,008 --> 00:11:28,600
Or else I'll give you a punch.
Did you hear me?

349
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:28,960
Yep.

350
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:31,440
If I were you,
I wouldn't be so unprofessional.

351
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,440
These are the rules of the game.

352
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,520
Yep.

353
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:36,064
Can you stop saying "yep"?

354
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,240
Yep.

355
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,040
Okay.

356
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,440
Let's go.

357
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:40,640
Just like that.

358
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,260
Your lines are good.

359
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:42,688
Pretty good.

360
00:11:42,688 --> 00:11:44,032
(Satisfied)

361
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,952
(After the short film shoot)
Two idiots, right?

362
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,680
And you were wiggling.

363
00:11:49,088 --> 00:11:50,624
(Reviewing the footage)

364
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:54,960
It's pretty good.

365
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,280
Okay.

366
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:56,880
Pleasure working with you.

367
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:57,800
Pleasure working with you.

368
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:58,600
Second collaboration.

369
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,360
Second collaboration.

370
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,920
- It's already the second drama.
- The second drama is finished. Alright.

371
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,320
Second collaboration complete.

372
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,000
Second collaboration complete.

373
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,600
Okay.

374
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:13,800
Is this the place for me?

375
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,240
Fei,

376
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:18,000
this is the scene where you

377
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,160
and your partner meet.

378
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:19,840
I was scared.

379
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,160
I thought this was my partner.

380
00:12:21,376 --> 00:12:22,752
(Plush teddy bear)

381
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,920
It is looking at me very affectionately.

382
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:28,960
How nice.

383
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,760
This old building.

384
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:32,680
Let me think.

385
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,480
I think logically
it should be Song Qian.

386
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,120
(Another one hoping for Qian)
I'm the one she knows best here.

387
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,120
Judging by the food,

388
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,160
it doesn't feel like a girl.

389
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,120
This...

390
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,520
This is so fierce.

391
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:46,320
Judging by the food,

392
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,680
it feels like only Liu Tianzuo
would come over.

393
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:52,280
Are all these the small French coffees?

394
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,560
But it's not bad.

395
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,160
It tastes very good.

396
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,680
Why are there three cups of coffee here?

397
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:56,680
(The mysterious third cup of coffee)

398
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,280
That cup

399
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,400
isn't ours, right?

400
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:00,920
Anyway, we are all acquaintances.

401
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,600
I don't think I need to be so polite.

402
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:05,160
I can eat my dessert first.

403
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,800
The ice cream is about to melt.

404
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:10,320
This isn't being impolite, guys.

405
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,800
It's my respect for the chef.

406
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:13,960
I think this dessert

407
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,400
is very similar to me.

408
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:22,200
(Savoring it carefully)

409
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,120
It's so delicious.

410
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:25,760
This might have been chosen
by Sun Honglei.

411
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,080
He would do this.

412
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,080
He wouldn't pick a hoe.

413
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,200
(Wishing sincerely)
But I hope it's a girl,

414
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,040
to be honest.

415
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:35,640
Right.

416
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:36,680
Why isn't

417
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,480
(Waiting anxiously)

418
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,320
my partner here yet?

419
00:13:38,624 --> 00:13:40,992
(At this moment, your partner)

420
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,480
Oh, no, my eyesight is bad.

421
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,120
(Can't seem to find you)

422
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:45,640
Oh, no.

423
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,920
(The long road to finding the partner)

424
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:51,960
This is so mysterious.

425
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:01,640
Cover my face.

426
00:14:01,967 --> 00:14:03,560
(Found him?)

427
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,200
Walk forward.

428
00:14:06,848 --> 00:14:09,216
(Your Naiwen is coming)

429
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,120
Is he here?

430
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,720
Tell him not to make any sound.

431
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:25,800
The person I originally imagined

432
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,440
has white hair.

433
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:32,720
(Matches the imagination)
He has a calm and steady personality

434
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,440
and a reserved temperament.

435
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,600
Because opposite me is a piece of glass,

436
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,640
but it's also a mirror at the same time.

437
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:41,880
It has a reflection.

438
00:14:42,222 --> 00:14:43,040
(Close-up appearance description)

439
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,000
Let's make contact.

440
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,040
When you found out it was me,

441
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,080
were you regretful too?

442
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,560
- Don't force yourself to laugh.
- You know what?

443
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,696
I really don't regret it.

444
00:14:53,696 --> 00:14:54,600
You want to be with me?

445
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,440
Yes.

446
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,440
Being with you,

447
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,760
I believe I am the most relaxed.

448
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:00,040
Yes, we even held hands.

449
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:02,880
(Must have a sense of ceremony)
Shouldn't we make contact?

450
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:04,384
(Satisfying you)
Bonjour.

451
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,600
Do we still need to make contact?

452
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,200
How about this?

453
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:09,360
A romantic place

454
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:11,040
needs a romantic

455
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,320
meeting ceremony.

456
00:15:12,576 --> 00:15:13,080
French style.

457
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:14,880
Come on.

458
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:15,808
Bonjour.

459
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:17,504
Bonjour.

460
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:18,680
Come on.

461
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:19,904
(The bears also need a French greeting)
What you said was "oh, yo".

462
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:21,056
Come on.

463
00:15:21,056 --> 00:15:21,984
Both sides.

464
00:15:21,984 --> 00:15:22,880
Yes, both sides.

465
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,440
Right.

466
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:25,960
Well,

467
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,120
how did you guess it was me?

468
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:27,920
There's a reflection here.

469
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:28,240
Really?

470
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:29,560
You know what?

471
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,520
If they hadn't reminded me,

472
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:31,720
I would have walked past.

473
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:32,880
Because my eyesight is bad.

474
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:35,200
- I didn't know who it was.
- And you were blocking with the bear.

475
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,680
(Buffs stacked)
And I didn't know where I was going.

476
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:39,080
They only told me it was nearby.

477
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,680
I even walked around

478
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,840
that park over there.

479
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,160
Then your task
was more tiring than mine.

480
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,800
Then I saw a girl.

481
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,560
Her height was a bit like Yuwen.

482
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:49,040
But she was walking a dog.

483
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:50,440
But I thought

484
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:52,160
maybe it was her disguise.

485
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:52,720
Her disguise.

486
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:53,664
But to be honest,

487
00:15:53,664 --> 00:15:54,800
I really couldn't see clearly.

488
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:55,880
When I got closer and looked,

489
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:56,840
it was indeed a foreigner.

490
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,760
Taste yours.

491
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:00,120
Okay.

492
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,400
What is this called again?

493
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:03,640
This?

494
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:04,920
This is called an egg tart.

495
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,120
No.

496
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,400
What kind of egg tart was it?

497
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,400
It's called Naiwen egg tart.

498
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:12,200
We should

499
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,960
thank this era

500
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,080
for the good life we live.

501
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,800
We even get to eat caramel macchiato.

502
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:18,640
In our impression,

503
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,280
(Memories of the era)
the only desserts were sugar flatbreads.

504
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,560
Donkey rolls.

505
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:23,760
In Tianjin, it's sugar fried dough.

506
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,160
Similar to donkey rolls.

507
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:29,520
Tianjin also has something
called sugar triangles.

508
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:32,440
- Steamed buns with brown sugar inside?
- Yes.

509
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:34,080
Yes, but it's triangles.

510
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:34,680
Beijing is the same.

511
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:37,960
Is this our mission today?

512
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,080
No problem.

513
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,000
(Easy win)
For us,

514
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,280
professional actors, it's no problem.

515
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,640
I even made a bet in the car.

516
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,080
What bet?

517
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,280
I said I guessed it was Wang Yuwen.

518
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,320
I said if I won,

519
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:55,200
I would decide the next episode's guest.

520
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:01,120
Now, I...

521
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:01,640
Look.

522
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:02,280
Do I have any...

523
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,320
Do I have any changes?

524
00:17:04,256 --> 00:17:05,760
(Expecting)

525
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:06,839
Don't compare me with this photo.

526
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:07,920
Compare me with my last recording.

527
00:17:08,319 --> 00:17:09,040
Say it out loud.

528
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,280
Say it to the audience.

529
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,319
Don't be so stingy.

530
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:13,160
(I'll say)
He has lost weight.

531
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:15,520
His face is tighter too.

532
00:17:16,119 --> 00:17:17,079
Am I getting closer?

533
00:17:17,079 --> 00:17:17,480
And then...

534
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,040
Forget it.

535
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,000
It's okay.

536
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:21,760
This is my earliest photo.

537
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,040
When you were young...

538
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:25,119
Do you hate your past self so much?

539
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,280
It's not hate.

540
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:29,120
Mine simply can't compare to yours.

541
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:31,760
Come on.

542
00:17:31,936 --> 00:17:32,896
(Starting rehearsal)

543
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,080
Has it started?

544
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:43,440
Wait.

545
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,680
How about this?

546
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:45,960
We two...

547
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,000
I'll order food first.

548
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,920
We should first...

549
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:52,240
We should meet first.

550
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,200
After we meet, you leave,

551
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:55,800
and I'll piece it together here.

552
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,360
Otherwise,

553
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:57,360
after I finish piecing it together,

554
00:17:57,360 --> 00:17:58,080
how can I turn around

555
00:17:58,560 --> 00:18:00,120
and know it's you?

556
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:01,880
I think this is more reasonable.

557
00:18:10,144 --> 00:18:11,040
Great.

558
00:18:12,832 --> 00:18:13,640
Let's go.

559
00:18:14,624 --> 00:18:17,504
I've been waiting for ten minutes.

560
00:18:17,504 --> 00:18:18,040
Right?

561
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:21,560
Ten minutes.

562
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:24,040
This baguette is like
a stick of incense.

563
00:18:25,856 --> 00:18:27,400
The later she comes,

564
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,160
(Hoping to see my partner
before finishing it)

565
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,400
the less baguette there'll be left.

566
00:18:31,104 --> 00:18:32,360
It's really delicious.

567
00:18:33,344 --> 00:18:35,616
(Qian is here)

568
00:18:37,984 --> 00:18:39,920
Let me search for my partner.

569
00:18:41,472 --> 00:18:43,040
Is he by the Seine River?

570
00:18:45,312 --> 00:18:46,600
It's either Fei or Xingxu.

571
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:52,440
It's

572
00:18:53,248 --> 00:18:54,400
a man.

573
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:55,872
Very tall.

574
00:18:55,872 --> 00:18:56,672
Is it Yuning?

575
00:18:56,672 --> 00:18:58,000
Or Lin Yi?

576
00:18:58,592 --> 00:19:00,512
His walking style
